{"strongs": "H5392", "word": "נֶ֫שֶׁךְ", "translit": "ne.shekh", "root": "נשך", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "interest, usury", "definition": "נֶ֫שֶׁךְ noun [masculine] interest, usury (literally something bitten off ); — ׳ נ absolute Exod 22:24 +; construct Deut 23:20 — with שִׂים עַלֿ Exod 22:24 ( E ); with לָקַח מִן Lev 25:36 , הֵשִׁיב מִן Ezek 18:17 , לָקַח Ezek 22:12 (no preposition), בְּנֶשֶׁךְ Lev 25:37 at interest , so Ps 15:5 ; Ezek 18:8 ; Ezek 18:13 ׳ בְּנ Prov 28:8 by usury ; as accusative of congnate meaning with verb Deut 23:20 (3 t. in verse).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5417')\">BDB5417</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5392')\">H5392</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5416')\">BDB5416</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5418')\">BDB5418</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נֶ֫שֶׁךְ</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>interest, usury</highlightword> (literally <highlight>something bitten off</highlight>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Exod 22:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,22,24)\">Exod 22:24</ref> +; construct <ref ref=\"Deut 23:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,20)\">Deut 23:20</ref> — with <bdbheb>שִׂים עַלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 22:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,22,24)\">Exod 22:24</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); with <bdbheb>לָקַח מִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 25:36\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,36)\">Lev 25:36</ref>, <bdbheb>הֵשִׁיב מִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 18:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,18,17)\">Ezek 18:17</ref>, <bdbheb>לָקַח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,12)\">Ezek 22:12</ref> (no preposition), <bdbheb>בְּנֶשֶׁךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 25:37\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,37)\">Lev 25:37</ref> <highlight>at interest</highlight>, so <ref ref=\"Ps 15:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,15,5)\">Ps 15:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 18:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,18,8)\">Ezek 18:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 18:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,18,13)\">Ezek 18:13</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּנ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 28:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,28,8)\">Prov 28:8</ref> <highlight>by usury</highlight>; as accusative of congnate meaning with verb <ref ref=\"Deut 23:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,20)\">Deut 23:20</ref> (3 t. in verse). </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 22:24", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 22, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Deut 23:20", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 23, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Lev 25:36", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 25, "verse": 36}, {"raw": "Ezek 18:17", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 18, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Ezek 22:12", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 22, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Lev 25:37", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 25, "verse": 37}, {"raw": "Ps 15:5", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ezek 18:8", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 18, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Ezek 18:13", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 18, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Prov 28:8", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 28, "verse": 8}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["נֶ֫שֶׁךְ", "׳", "נ", "שִׂים עַלֿ", "לָקַח מִן", "הֵשִׁיב מִן", "לָקַח", "בְּנֶשֶׁךְ", "בְּנ"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["E"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB5417", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}